:: X-Change Gray Widgets [widget]
	/* Effect name -> $xchange.pill flag. Pure twee, no JS dependency.
	   Sets _effectFlag ("" if unknown). */
	<<widget "xchange-effect-flag">>
		<<switch _args[0]>>
		<<case "genderflip">><<set _effectFlag to "genderflipEffect">>
		<<case "crossdress">><<set _effectFlag to "genderificationEffect">>
		<<case "herm">><<set _effectFlag to "hermEffect">>
		<<case "xtend">><<set _effectFlag to "xtendEffect">>
		<<case "resistance">><<set _effectFlag to "resistanceEffect">>
		<<case "continue">><<set _effectFlag to "continueEffect">>
		<<case "fertile">><<set _effectFlag to "fertile">>
		<<case "breeder">><<set _effectFlag to "breederEffect">>
		<<case "bull">><<set _effectFlag to "bullEffect">>
		<<case "omega">><<set _effectFlag to "omegaEffect">>
		<<case "alpha">><<set _effectFlag to "alphaEffect">>
		<<case "portal">><<set _effectFlag to "portalEffect">>
		<<case "passion">><<set _effectFlag to "passionEffect">>
		<<case "dumb-bitch">><<set _effectFlag to "dumbBitchEffect">>
		<<case "innocence">><<set _effectFlag to "innocenceEffect">>
		<<case "feartoxin">><<set _effectFlag to "feartoxinEffect">>
		<<case "swell">><<set _effectFlag to "swellEffect">>
		<<case "bimbo">><<set _effectFlag to "bimboEffect">>
		<<case "cumcure">><<set _effectFlag to "cumcureEffect">>
		<<case "fertility">><<set _effectFlag to "hyperFertilityEffect">>
		<<case "choice">><<set _effectFlag to "choiceEffect">>
		<<default>><<set _effectFlag to "">>
		<</switch>>
	<</widget>>

	/* Stack one or more effects onto an already-active pill without resetting the session. */
	<<widget "xchange-stackeffects">>
		<<set _days to _args[0]>><<set _newEffects to Array.isArray(_args[1]) ? _args[1] : _args.slice(1)>>
		<<if xchangePillProtectionActive()>>
			/* Temporary therapy and permanent X-Change purity prevent new effects from stacking onto a running session. */
			<span class="blue">The X-Change pill dissolves harmlessly, your resistance keeping anything new from taking hold.</span>
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			<<if $xchange.pill.clone is undefined>><<set $xchange.pill.clone to "none">><</if>>
			<<for _effect range _newEffects>>
				/* Continue and Resistance act on the session itself (duration/permanence), so any active session qualifies. */
				/* Skip if this effect is already running. */
				<<xchange-effect-flag _effect>>
				<<if _effectFlag isnot "" and $xchange.pill[_effectFlag]>>
					<<continue>>
				<</if>>
				<<xchange-addeffect _effect _days>>
			<</for>>
			<<xchange-fertility-override>>
			/* Give newly stacked effects enough time to matter, but don't shorten the running pill. */
			<<if !pillIsPermanent()>>
				<<set $xchange.pill.duration to Math.max($xchange.pill.duration || 0, _days * 24 - 1)>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	/* Take a gray pill: effect-only, no forced genderflip. */
	<<widget "xchange-gray">>
		<<set _duration to _args[0]>>
		<<set _effects to _args.slice(1)>>

		<<if playerIsXChanged()>>
			/* A session is running: add to the current body without resetting the pill. */
			<<xchange-stackeffects _duration _effects>>
			<<exposedcheck>>
		<<else>>
			/* No session: start a fresh session.
			   Setting "$xchange.grayPillGenderflip" decides whether a standalone gray pill also swaps gender (effect on a new body) or keeps the original body (effect-only).
			   Default/undefined = original body. */
			<<save-body>>
			<<if $xchange.grayPillGenderflip>>
				<<run _effects.unshift("genderflip")>>
			<</if>>
			<<xchange-effects _duration _effects>>
			<<exposedcheck>>
			<<set $xchange.timesTaken.player++>>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	/* Gray extender: add days to a running X-Change session without adding a body flip. */
	<<widget "xchange-extend">>
		<<set _days to _args[0]>>
		<<set _ensure to _args.slice(1)>>

		<<if playerIsXChanged() and !pillIsPermanent()>>
			<<set $xchange.pill.duration to $xchange.pill.duration + _days * 24>>
			<<if $xchange.pill.clone is undefined>><<set $xchange.pill.clone to "none">><</if>>
			<<for _effect range _ensure>>
				<<xchange-effect-flag _effect>>
				<<if _effectFlag is "" or !$xchange.pill[_effectFlag]>>
					<<xchange-addeffect _effect _days>>
				<</if>>
			<</for>>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>


:: Pharmacy Gray Ask
<<effects>>
You nod at the small gray section of the shelf. 
"Why don't you carry the full gray line? You stock every other X-Change variant under the sun."
<br><br>
The <<person>> glances at the shelf, then back at you.
"Those are a higher-end product than the usual line. Newer process, smaller batches. 
We get what we get, and the special stock changes every week."
<br><br>
<<He>> shrugs and goes back to <<his>> book.
"Don't ask me why. We're not the ones who choose what goes on that shelf. <span class="elk">They</span> are."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Pharmacy]]>><</link>>

/* LANDRY */
:: Pub Landry Gray News
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<npc Landry>><<person1>>
The bartender doesn't even need to point this time. 
Landry is already waving you over, and there's something different about <<him>>. 
The wariness that usually sits behind <<his>> eyes has been replaced by something that looks almost like excitement.
<br><br>
"There <<pshe>> <<pverb "is" "are">>." <<He>> pushes a drink towards you as you sit.
"I was starting to think I'd have to send the little fox to fetch you. We've had a breakthrough."
<br><br>
<<He>> leans in, voice dropping.
<br><br>
"Mickey's been living inside that card since the heist. Money flow, shipment manifests, supplier accounts, the lot. 
They didn't just find out <i>who</i> moves the pills." <<He>> taps the table. 
"They found out <i>how they're made</i>. Batch records. Formulations. The whole kitchen."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Pub Landry Gray News 2]]>><</link>>

:: Pub Landry Gray News 2
<<effects>>
<<run setup.ensureGrayPharmacyItems()>>
<<set _landryPrice to setup.pharmacyItems.xchange_gray_breeder.price * 2>>
"So I called in some favours. People I trust, people with the right equipment and short memories." 
<<He>> reaches into <<his>> coat and sets something on the table between you, shielded by <<his>> hand: 
a small bottle of colourless capsules.
<br><br>
"We're calling them <span class="teal">gray pills</span>. 
Every X-Change effect you've seen like the fertility lines, the body work, all of it but with the swap agent stripped out.
No forced pink, no forced blue. You take one, you stay <i>you</i>, and the effect works with whatever body you're wearing. 
Take it on its own, or on top of a regular pill. Your choice, for once."
<br><br>
<<He>> sits back, clearly pleased with <<himself>>.
<br><br>
"Safer. Controlled. Properly dosed, properly tested. The catch is they're a nightmare to make quietly. 
Which brings us to the part you won't like." <<He>> turns the bottle so the light catches it.
"<span class="gold"><<printprice _landryPrice>></span> a pill."
<br><br>
<<link [[Protest the price|Pub Landry Gray Protest]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Accept the price|Pub Landry Gray Accept]]>><</link>>

:: Pub Landry Gray Protest
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy"))>>
	"That's... the hospital sells theirs for half that," you manage.
<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant"))>>
	"That much?" you say. "The hospital charges half that. You're aware of this, I assume."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"The hospital's are cheaper," you say quietly. "Half the price."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You frown. "Twice the hospital price. Try again."
<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel"))>>
	"Twice the hospital price? Did the heist knock something loose in your head?" you hiss.
<<else>>
	"That's twice what the hospital charges," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Landry doesn't even react at first. <<He>> has clearly rehearsed this.
<br><br>
"It is. And here's what the hospital price doesn't buy you." <<He>> raises a finger. 
"One: making these <i>safely</i> costs real money.
Clean equipment, proper testing, people who know what they're doing and get paid enough not to talk about it."
<br><br>
A second finger. "Two: security. Every batch we make is a batch <span class="elk">the master's</span> people could trace. 
Staying invisible isn't free. A chunk of every pill goes straight into making sure there's nothing left to find."
<br><br>
A third finger. "Three: and check their shelf sometime if you don't believe me... the hospital doesn't carry the full gray line. 
Never has. A few stable ones, the odd special when it suits whoever does their ordering. 
I carry <i>everything</i>. You're not paying double for the same product. 
You're paying for the complete catalogue, made by people who aren't owned by the man we're trying to bury."
<br><br>
<<link [[Accept the price|Pub Landry Gray Accept]]>><</link>>

:: Pub Landry Gray Accept
<<effects>>
<<if $xchange.grayPills is undefined>><<set $xchange.grayPills to {}>><</if>>
<<set $xchange.grayPills.landryIntro to true>>
"Fine," you say. "I get it."
<br><br>
"Knew you'd see sense." Landry pockets the bottle and raises one cautioning hand before you can reach for your money.
<br><br>
"One rule. <span class="gold">One pill per day.</span> Not negotiable. 
Every single capsule gets made to order and walked through three pairs of hands before it reaches this table. 
That's how it stays clean, and that's how nobody upstream notices a pattern. 
You want bulk, go queue at the hospital with everyone else and take your chances with whatever
<span class="elk">they</span> decided to put in this week."
<br><br>
<<He>> settles back into the booth.
<br><br>
"So. Want to see the catalogue?"
<br><br>
<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link [[See what Landry has|Pub Landry Gray Shop]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pub Landry Gray Shop
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<npc Landry>><<person1>><<run setup.ensureGrayPharmacyItems()>>
<<set _landryPrice to setup.pharmacyItems.xchange_gray_breeder.price * 2>>
<<if $daily.landryGrayPill>>
	Landry shakes <<his>> head before you finish asking.
	<br><br>
	"Already sold you one today. The next batch is still being made, carefully, which is the entire point. Come back tomorrow."
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif $money lt (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(_landryPrice) : _landryPrice)>>
	Landry gives you an apologetic look as you count what you have.
	<br><br>
	"<<printprice _landryPrice>>, flat. I can't do credit on these; every pill is paid for before it's made. Come back when you're holding."
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	Landry glances around the pub once, then produces a slim, hand-written list and slides it across the table. No labels, just names.
	"One per day. <span class="gold"><<printprice _landryPrice>>.</span> Pick."
	<br><br>
	/* Landry carries the complete line: derive it from the registered items rather than restating the key list.
	A new gray pill registered in xchange.js automatically appears here. Portal stays gated. */
	<<set _landryStock to Object.keys(setup.pharmacyItems).filter(function (k) { return k.indexOf("xchange_gray_") === 0 && (k !== "xchange_gray_portal" || State.variables.portalPantiesEnabled); })>>
	<<for _gKey range _landryStock>>
		<<set _gItem to setup.pharmacyItems[_gKey]>>
		<<set _gLabel to _gItem.name>>
		<<capture _gItem _gLabel _landryPrice>>
			<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link _gLabel "Pub Landry Gray Bought">><<set $xchange.grayPills.lastBought to _gItem.type>><<set $pharmacyItem to _gItem>><<money `-_landryPrice` "pharmacyXChange">><<pharmacyAddOwned 1>><<boughtOnce>><<set $daily.landryGrayPill to true>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</capture>>
	<</for>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Not today|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Pub Landry Gray Bought
<<effects>>
You slide the money across the table. 
Landry makes it disappear without seeming to move, then presses a single colourless capsule into your palm,
wrapped in a twist of paper.
<br><br>
"<span class="teal"><<print $xchange.grayPills.lastBought>></span>.
Made fresh, handled clean." <<He>> taps the side of <<his>> nose. "Same time tomorrow if you want another.
And if anyone asks where you got it... say you didn't know."
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
